hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"64","[AI-translation] Nu'man bin Bashir se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam juma mein ""Sabbih isma rabbika al-a'la"" aur ""Hal ataka hadith al-ghashiyah"" padhte the, aur kabhi eid aur juma ek saath aa jate to un dono mein yahi dono padhte the."
"65","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundab se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam juma ki namaz mein ""Sabbih isma rabbika al-a'la"" aur ""Hal ataka hadith al-ghashiyah"" padhte the."
"66","[AI-translation] Nu'man bin Bashir se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam juma mein ""Sabbih isma rabbika al-a'la"" aur ""Hal ataka hadith al-ghashiyah"" padhte the, aur kabhi eid aur juma ek saath aa jate to un dono mein yahi dono padhte the."
